=20
these matters with the ability to affect the changes implied by their=20
conclusions is what is needed. Control is an entirely worthless concept to=
=20
lojban that only serves to make the language incredibly brittle overtime.=
=20
It represents nothing but obstacles for the language's inevitable evolution=
=20
over time. The dispositions of capable jbopre are enough. We do not need to=
=20
further institutionalize is dramatically saturated and vivid gridlock.=20

